    <briefdescription>
<para>Zip iterator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Allows iterating over multiple sequences simultaneously.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Array&lt;int&gt;<sp/>a<sp/>=<sp/>{1,<sp/>2,<sp/>3}<sp/>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Array&lt;String&gt;<sp/>b<sp/>=<sp/>{&quot;a&quot;,<sp/>&quot;b&quot;,<sp/>&quot;c&quot;}<sp/>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">for<sp/>(const<sp/>auto&amp;<sp/>[x,<sp/>y]<sp/>:<sp/>Zip(a,<sp/>b))</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>x<sp/>=<sp/>1,<sp/>y<sp/>=<sp/>&quot;a&quot;<sp/>;<sp/>x<sp/>=<sp/>2,<sp/>y<sp/>=<sp/>&quot;b&quot;<sp/>;<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
